= Serannus Plan Ratified

The Serannus Plan is finally ratified, and with that, the main reason President DuFour and the [? if not lvp_formed and in_grand_coalition: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed or not in_grand_coalition: propertied right?] has been keeping us around is gone. DuFour has notified Chancellor [+ chancellor +] that he expects a sweeping reform of Commonwealth finances soon, a challenging task in a government like this. With the War Loans eased, talk of rebuilding the Commonwealth's armies — unthinkable under the old terms — has crept back into the halls of power, and DuFour's circle has not been deaf to it.

- @joever: If this year couldn't get any worse...

@joever

[? if in_grand_coalition or (in_weimar_coalition and lvp_formed): The [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] may bring up the Poorman's Pension issue again.?][? if in_popular_front or in_left_front or (in_weimar_coalition and not lvp_formed): DuFour's inner circle is determined to have him expel us from government[? if in_popular_front or in_left_front:, especially with our cooperation with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>?]. ?]